# Patterns are anchored to the build-context root; use **/ to match at any depth.

# Secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Deployment manifests: not part of any image
charts/

# VCS / editors / OS
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
**/.DS_Store

# AI assistants and agent tooling
**/.claude/
**/CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/GEMINI.md
**/.gemini/
**/.cursor/
**/.cursorrules
**/.windsurf/
**/.windsurfrules
**/.codex/
**/.aider*
**/.mcp.json
.mdd/

# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.turbo/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Tests and reports
**/coverage/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/blob-report/
**/playwright/.auth/

# Logs and local overrides
**/*.log
lefthook-local.yml
